# Root-level .md scratch/dev-history notes.
# Many ad-hoc .md files accumulate at the project root during development and
# reveal internal history (e.g. WEBVIEW_SECURITY_FIX.md, SSL_ERROR_BYPASS_WARNING_FIX.md,
# ADBLOCKER_DEFAULTS.md, BUILD_FIX.md, ...). They should not be shipped or made public.
# Scoped to the ROOT ONLY (leading slash) so legitimate docs in subdirectories are
# still tracked: docs/superpowers/**, subs/**, .github/**, fastlane/**, etc.
# Explicitly re-include the operational root documents below.
/*.md
!/README.md
!/CHANGELOG.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/RELEASE_CHECKLIST.md
